# GitHub Linguist Language Overrides

# 1. Mark third-party SDK packages as vendored (excluded from language statistics)
packages/** linguist-vendored

# 2. Explicitly classify headers and source files as C++
*.h linguist-language=C++
*.hpp linguist-language=C++
*.cpp linguist-language=C++
src/** linguist-language=C++

# 3. Classify QML & Resources
*.qml linguist-language=QML
*.qrc linguist-language=XML
*.rc linguist-language=C++
*.pro linguist-language=C++
